370
00:14:42,696 --> 00:14:44,318
That's my partner, Sam Slade.

371
00:14:44,318 --> 00:14:45,732
- Hi.

372
00:14:45,732 --> 00:14:47,276
- McCartin's the name.

373
00:14:47,276 --> 00:14:48,715
