I'm not sure.

425
00:16:36,958 --> 00:16:39,713
Joe Strummer goes fishing.

426
00:16:39,713 --> 00:16:43,173
(speaking foreign language)

427
00:16:43,173 --> 00:16:44,968
- Two of the divers didn't come up Joe.

428
00:16:44,968 --> 00:16:47,203
They think they're gone.

429
00:16:47,203 --> 00:16:48,209
