442
00:17:28,824 --> 00:17:33,034
- [Mike] I should visit
Taneil when I'm ashore.

443
00:17:33,034 --> 00:17:35,701
- [Servo] The mackerels in the--

444
00:17:38,354 --> 00:17:39,500
- He's dead.

445
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:40,723
- Dead huh?

446
00:17:40,723 --> 00:17:41,879
