463
00:18:13,953 --> 00:18:15,914
- [Crow] Oh I got back.

464
00:18:15,914 --> 00:18:17,590
- Sure, with a hat full of gold.

465
00:18:17,590 --> 00:18:19,302
- [Mike] Ha, you get it.

466
00:18:19,302 --> 00:18:20,469
- That's that.

467
00:18:21,829 --> 00:18:22,895
- Yeah okay.

468
00:18:22,895 --> 00:18:25,812
