476
00:18:53,359 --> 00:18:55,308
- [Crow] Driving Miss Dummy.

477
00:18:55,308 --> 00:18:57,526
- [Mike] Wait, that
doesn't really work at all.

478
00:18:57,526 --> 00:18:58,531
- [Crow] Really.

479
00:18:58,531 --> 00:19:01,105
