barrels coming on board now.

504
00:20:24,608 --> 00:20:28,411
- [Mike] Well clear the stage
for a campy musical review.

505
00:20:28,411 --> 00:20:30,197
- Keep back here boy.

506
00:20:30,197 --> 00:20:31,338
