this joker's got in mind.

515
00:20:47,499 --> 00:20:48,491
Where is he?

516
00:20:48,491 --> 00:20:49,741
- Come on then.

517
00:20:50,859 --> 00:20:52,183
- [Servo] Well here's the script.

518
00:20:52,183 --> 00:20:55,683
You take my part in the movie for a while.

519
00:20:58,375 --> 00:21:00,046
- [Mike] Their Polynesian torch ceremony

520
00:21:00,046 --> 00:21:03,287
