521
00:21:03,287 --> 00:21:04,416
- What's going on here?

522
00:21:04,416 --> 00:21:08,166
- They think a shark
got the man who is lost.

523
00:21:11,283 --> 00:21:15,450
♫ I will call you ♫

524
00:21:19,585 --> 00:21:21,852
- Mister McCartin I hear you got a beef.

525
00:21:21,852 --> 00:21:24,320
- You were snoopin' around out there.

526
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:25,712
